alloc_pool Local         -> Shared
alloc_pool On_device     -> Shared
alloc_pool Effectively_constant -> Shared
alloc_pool (no mode)     -> Shared
from_host/to_host at offset>0 preserves values: true
zero_ranges at offset>0 reads back zeros: true
zero_ranges fills the second pool's range in the same call: true
offset>0 ops leave region A (offset 0) intact: true
